WEBVTT

01:54.280 --> 01:55.480
Isn't it beautiful?

01:57.720 --> 02:00.080
My lady, you aren't admiring
the velvet flower

02:00.160 --> 02:01.720
but the person who made it, are you?

02:03.120 --> 02:05.560
It's not easy for women to do business.

02:06.360 --> 02:07.680
I am a woman,

02:08.840 --> 02:09.720
so,

02:10.800 --> 02:12.040
I'm happy to help other women

02:12.640 --> 02:13.880
if they know what's good for them.

02:16.480 --> 02:17.640
What is Hua Rong up to?

02:18.360 --> 02:21.760
She's pushing the Ji family
to take on many orders for Flushed Rose.

02:22.520 --> 02:23.920
She even sent people

02:24.000 --> 02:25.960
to monitor the Brocade Bureau
in charge of registration.

02:27.120 --> 02:29.040
What do you think of her?

02:30.520 --> 02:31.720
Smart,

02:31.800 --> 02:32.840
ruthless,

02:33.720 --> 02:34.560
but still not enough.

02:35.160 --> 02:38.760
If there's a mistake
in the registration in Yizhou City,

02:38.840 --> 02:40.440
it's close enough to be dealt with.

02:40.960 --> 02:43.480
Since Miss Ji is so clever,

02:43.560 --> 02:45.280
she must have a plan.

02:47.520 --> 02:48.720
Rest assured, my lady.

02:49.320 --> 02:51.480
I've already prepared
a backup plan for this matter.

02:52.560 --> 02:53.800
Whether we should act or not

02:54.480 --> 02:56.000
depends entirely on your decision.

03:03.040 --> 03:04.800
It all depends on what she decides.

03:22.720 --> 03:25.760
Shu's splendor is for everyone to share.

03:26.640 --> 03:29.560
Today's Splendor Showcase
celebrates the champion.

03:30.080 --> 03:31.440
Let all trades rejoice!

03:32.600 --> 03:33.440
Let's begin!

03:33.520 --> 03:36.360
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

03:41.600 --> 03:43.720
Wen… Wen Jun's Wine,

03:43.800 --> 03:45.240
eight wen for a jar,

03:45.320 --> 03:47.240
15 wen for two jars.

03:47.320 --> 03:48.800
- Wenjun…
- Louder!

03:49.440 --> 03:51.400
If you can help me
sell ten jars of wine today,

03:51.480 --> 03:53.560
I won't hold you accountable
for the damage you caused

03:53.640 --> 03:54.560
in my inn the other day.

03:55.160 --> 03:56.960
It was truly disgraceful.

03:57.640 --> 03:59.040
Please don't bring it up again.

03:59.640 --> 04:00.880
What's the harm?

04:00.960 --> 04:03.280
An elder brother
standing up for his younger sister…

04:03.360 --> 04:04.760
That's something I can only envy.

04:05.400 --> 04:07.000
- Really?
- Of course.

04:10.280 --> 04:12.240
This is livelier than just selling silk.

04:13.480 --> 04:16.000
No one dares stop me from selling now.

04:16.640 --> 04:17.680
What are you selling?

04:18.519 --> 04:21.279
Selling… Selling my charm!

04:29.560 --> 04:30.760
Oh, nothing.

04:31.880 --> 04:33.560
Why isn't Zhao Xiuyuan here?

04:33.640 --> 04:34.920
Isn't he coming today?

04:35.000 --> 04:36.200
He's busy weaving brocade.

04:36.280 --> 04:37.200
He'll come later.

04:38.000 --> 04:40.600
Now, even Mr. Zhao Senior
doesn't stop you from seeing him.

04:40.680 --> 04:42.000
Is the marriage getting close?

04:42.600 --> 04:44.560
Now that he's showing his talent,

04:44.640 --> 04:47.480
Mr. Zhao Senior
probably thinks he's a rare gem.

04:47.560 --> 04:48.840
You don't seem worried at all.

04:48.920 --> 04:50.920
Do you think I'm not good enough for him?

04:51.000 --> 04:52.560
That's not what I meant.

04:53.200 --> 04:54.720
I was joking with you.

04:55.400 --> 04:57.360
As long as we're of one heart,

04:57.440 --> 04:58.680
nothing can stand between us.

05:01.880 --> 05:03.000
Excuse me, my lady!

05:06.440 --> 05:07.440
You dropped your handkerchief.

05:12.600 --> 05:13.880
Thank you, Miss Ji.

05:19.160 --> 05:20.840
Why is it her, the jinx?

05:20.920 --> 05:21.960
Do you know her?

05:22.800 --> 05:24.200
She's Niu Wuniang,

05:24.280 --> 05:26.040
the youngest daughter
of Vice Commander Niu.

05:26.120 --> 05:27.640
It's said she'll bring misfortune.

05:27.720 --> 05:29.400
She's lost two husbands to death.

05:30.040 --> 05:32.400
She's always wearing
either a veil or a mask.

05:32.480 --> 05:33.640
And she's extremely arrogant.

05:34.680 --> 05:35.600
Even more arrogant than you?

05:36.320 --> 05:38.280
Last time, I spoke to her,
and she didn't even bother to reply.

05:38.360 --> 05:40.120
If she looks down on you,

05:40.200 --> 05:43.600
then we common folk
must be nothing but dust in her eyes.

05:44.560 --> 05:46.000
She just called me Miss Ji.

05:46.080 --> 05:46.960
She knows me?

05:47.480 --> 05:49.840
Being recognized by her
is not a good thing.

05:49.920 --> 05:50.920
Wen Jun's Wine!

05:51.680 --> 05:53.200
Eight wen for a jar!

05:53.720 --> 05:55.400
Fifteen wen for two jars!

05:56.200 --> 05:57.440
Wen Jun's Wine!

05:57.520 --> 06:01.200
- When did my brother start selling wine?
- Fifteen wen for two jars!

06:03.800 --> 06:04.640
I'll take ten jars,

06:05.720 --> 06:06.680
as gifts.

06:08.000 --> 06:08.920
What are you trying to do?

06:09.000 --> 06:10.400
Are you doing this

06:10.480 --> 06:11.760
to make it up to me

06:12.640 --> 06:14.960
or just to ease your own conscience?

06:18.200 --> 06:20.280
I must have disturbed you.
I'll take my leave.

06:31.240 --> 06:33.680
- This money…
- Why not take it?

06:34.560 --> 06:36.120
And this pouch?

06:36.800 --> 06:39.320
I bought it to give him as a gift.

06:41.440 --> 06:43.720
- Don't you want it anymore?
- No, I don't.

06:44.360 --> 06:46.000
Things or people from the past…

06:46.760 --> 06:48.400
What's worth holding onto?

06:49.080 --> 06:51.920
Wen Jun's Wine, eight wen for a jar!

06:52.000 --> 06:53.520
Fifteen wen for two jars!

06:54.400 --> 06:55.280
Wen Jun's Wine!

06:55.360 --> 06:58.160
Tell me, compared to Mr. Yang,
how is my brother?

06:58.960 --> 07:00.200
Compare what aspects? Height?

07:00.280 --> 07:03.040
- Is Yang Jingshan tall?
- Compare their talents.

07:04.080 --> 07:05.880
Yang Jingshan is Yizhou's Brocade Master.

07:07.320 --> 07:08.640
Then, how about
personal qualities and demeanor?

07:08.720 --> 07:10.160
My brother surely wins, doesn't he?

07:10.240 --> 07:11.280
In terms of personal qualities,

07:11.880 --> 07:12.880
your brother surely wins.

07:12.960 --> 07:14.040
Mr. Yang, please have a seat.

07:16.040 --> 07:16.960
What are you doing here?

07:17.040 --> 07:19.200
I haven't even settled accounts
with you for last time.

07:19.280 --> 07:21.520
I was bored yesterday
and caught this in the mountains.

07:21.600 --> 07:23.080
I was planning
to give it to my good buddy,

07:23.160 --> 07:24.240
but…

07:24.320 --> 07:26.240
We're good buddies!

07:26.320 --> 07:27.480
You're the best!

07:29.600 --> 07:30.760
Is this what you're selling today?

07:32.240 --> 07:33.440
Mr. Yang, you want to know about it?

07:34.720 --> 07:36.760
Tell me, what's the price I have to pay?

07:39.600 --> 07:41.160
For today's Splendor Showcase,

07:41.240 --> 07:43.320
brocade families
are participating in full!

07:43.400 --> 07:45.720
Of course,
we must compete for the top spot.

07:45.800 --> 07:47.080
Excuse me…

07:47.160 --> 07:48.360
Excuse me, please.

07:54.640 --> 07:57.160
The Splendor Showcase's champion

07:57.240 --> 07:58.560
is selected from legitimate dyehouses

07:58.640 --> 08:01.520
with proper paperwork to sell here.

08:01.600 --> 08:04.600
Those relying
on shady tricks have no chance.

08:04.680 --> 08:06.080
They don't qualify.

08:06.160 --> 08:07.720
And yet, they have
the nerve to join the fun!

08:14.880 --> 08:19.240
The third-place winner
of this Splendor Showcase

08:19.320 --> 08:22.760
sold 170 guan worth.

08:23.400 --> 08:25.360
It goes to Mr. Wang from Wang's Dyehouse!

08:25.440 --> 08:27.840
- Well done!
- Well done!

08:31.600 --> 08:32.679
Mr. Wang,

08:32.760 --> 08:34.520
you should thank Mr. Sun properly.

08:34.600 --> 08:36.080
Your prize was thanks to him.

08:38.679 --> 08:39.799
Thank you, Mr. Yang.

08:40.880 --> 08:42.000
Thank you, Mr. Sun.

08:46.040 --> 08:48.200
The second-place winner
of the Splendor Showcase

08:48.280 --> 08:50.160
sold 190 guan worth!

08:50.240 --> 08:51.360
It goes to Sun's Dyehouse!

08:52.320 --> 08:53.960
- Well done!
- Well done!

08:54.040 --> 08:55.720
- Well done!
- Well done!

08:55.800 --> 08:56.800
What a coincidence.

08:56.880 --> 08:59.600
Mr. Sun, your prize
was contributed by Mr. Wang.

08:59.680 --> 09:00.960
If you're unhappy with it,

09:01.040 --> 09:02.960
you can always swap it
for your jade Kylin.

09:04.280 --> 09:06.040
I like it. I like it very much.

09:07.360 --> 09:08.360
Thank you, Mr. Yang.

09:12.720 --> 09:13.600
Thank you, Mr. Wang.

09:15.440 --> 09:16.320
Ladies and gentlemen,

09:17.560 --> 09:21.080
the top prize of this Splendor Showcase

09:21.160 --> 09:25.040
sold 230 guan worth!

09:26.640 --> 09:28.440
It goes to Hua's Dyehouse!

09:29.560 --> 09:31.440
- Well done!
- Well done!

09:32.320 --> 09:33.520
Amazing!

09:33.600 --> 09:34.760
Well done!

09:38.960 --> 09:39.880
Mrs. Hua,

09:41.040 --> 09:42.480
I'm returning this to its original owner.

09:46.840 --> 09:47.760
Thank you, Mr. Yang.

09:47.840 --> 09:49.360
These peonies are too small.

09:49.440 --> 09:52.440
Besides, I'm not a fan of flowers.

09:52.520 --> 09:54.880
Next time, Mrs. Hua,
put more thought into your gift.

09:56.160 --> 09:57.160
And also,

09:57.680 --> 09:59.760
to the other shopkeepers, rest assured.

09:59.840 --> 10:01.000
The prizes you've added

10:01.080 --> 10:03.240
will be returned to each of you shortly.

10:03.880 --> 10:04.840
Oh, by the way,

10:06.320 --> 10:07.480
just to mention,

10:08.520 --> 10:10.480
Miss Ji's team from Bloom Society

10:10.560 --> 10:11.880
didn't have the proper entry papers,

10:11.960 --> 10:13.200
so they don't officially count.

10:13.280 --> 10:17.440
But their Flushed Rose sold a total of…

10:20.520 --> 10:21.560
How much was it again?

10:21.640 --> 10:24.000
Two hundred and fifty guan!

10:24.080 --> 10:25.840
Two hundred and fifty guan!

10:25.920 --> 10:27.280
They sold 250 guans worth!

10:27.360 --> 10:28.720
Thank you.

10:28.800 --> 10:29.880
That's even more than the champion.

10:29.960 --> 10:31.280
I know this Miss Ji,

10:31.360 --> 10:33.640
but what… what exactly
is the Bloom Society?

10:34.280 --> 10:36.160
Ladies and gentlemen…
Ladies and gentlemen!

10:37.040 --> 10:37.960
Guys, come here!

10:39.920 --> 10:42.960
Our Bloom Society was established jointly

10:43.040 --> 10:44.800
by Huanhua Dyehouse, Luoxia Dyehouse,

10:44.880 --> 10:46.080
Yingxi Dyehouse,

10:46.160 --> 10:48.000
and Liuyue Dyehouse.

10:48.800 --> 10:51.400
It's newly founded, but we are ambitious.

10:51.480 --> 10:54.720
We aim to become
the best dyehouse group in Yizhou!

10:54.800 --> 10:57.560
Your guidance is much appreciated!

10:57.640 --> 11:00.360
- Thank you for your guidance!
- Thank you for your guidance!

11:06.920 --> 11:09.000
These velvet flowers represent prosperity.

11:09.080 --> 11:10.640
They are our Bloom Society's creation,

11:10.720 --> 11:13.320
dyed with signature silk threads
from various houses.

11:13.400 --> 11:15.360
They symbolize wealth and honor,

11:15.440 --> 11:16.960
peace and prosperity!

11:17.560 --> 11:19.240
Today, we present them to all of you

11:19.320 --> 11:22.040
as a token of our humble sincerity.

11:22.120 --> 11:24.160
May Yizhou's silk industry

11:24.240 --> 11:26.600
blossom like all sorts of flowers
and compete in splendor!

11:27.720 --> 11:29.560
This is dyed with our Midnight Purple,

11:29.640 --> 11:32.280
wishing everyone success in all endeavors!

11:32.360 --> 11:33.720
This is our Red Azalea,

11:33.800 --> 11:35.920
wishing you peace and happiness!

11:36.000 --> 11:37.480
This is our Cambodian Indigo,

11:37.560 --> 11:39.760
wishing everyone health and longevity!

11:39.840 --> 11:42.000
These are our Pine Flower and Azure Waves,

11:42.080 --> 11:45.120
offering elegance,
dignity, and a slimming effect!

11:45.760 --> 11:47.320
Though my house has no flowers,

11:47.400 --> 11:49.840
I am the honorary president
of Bloom Society.

11:49.920 --> 11:51.960
Thank you for your support!
From now on, we're all friends!

11:52.040 --> 11:54.640
If you like it,
please come to Bloom Society…

11:54.720 --> 11:56.400
- To place silk orders!
- To place silk orders!

11:57.000 --> 11:58.000
Let's go!

11:58.080 --> 11:58.920
Come on!

11:59.000 --> 11:59.880
We're all friends here!

12:00.480 --> 12:01.560
Welcome to place orders for silk!

12:05.120 --> 12:07.720
Thank you, Mr. Yang,
for adding this finishing touch.

12:07.800 --> 12:08.880
Welcome to place silk orders!

12:10.280 --> 12:11.120
Here!

12:11.200 --> 12:14.160
Wishing everyone wealth and honor,
peace and prosperity!

12:14.240 --> 12:15.640
Share them around!

12:15.720 --> 12:16.800
Here!

12:16.880 --> 12:18.800
Remember, we're Bloom Society!

12:18.880 --> 12:20.040
For silk orders,
come to us at Bloom Society.

12:20.120 --> 12:21.320
Madam, what's wrong?

12:21.400 --> 12:22.360
Here!

12:23.760 --> 12:25.640
Wishing you peace and prosperity,
wealth and honor!

12:25.720 --> 12:26.960
Do you still need more?

12:27.040 --> 12:29.280
Madam, is the master here to see us?

12:29.880 --> 12:31.280
You fool.

12:31.360 --> 12:32.680
The master isn't here to see us.

12:33.440 --> 12:35.040
She comes to see Ji Yingying.

12:39.800 --> 12:43.160
Bloom Society!

12:43.240 --> 12:48.720
Bloom Society!

12:48.800 --> 12:50.080
Good luck!

12:50.160 --> 12:51.720
Keeping Ji Yingying alive

12:52.600 --> 12:54.080
is nothing but trouble.

12:54.160 --> 12:58.160
Bloom Society!

13:13.480 --> 13:14.320
Yingying.

13:15.360 --> 13:17.520
I'm sorry. I was late.

13:17.600 --> 13:19.080
Apparently, I'm the one who was late.

13:19.680 --> 13:21.120
I was late.

13:21.200 --> 13:22.800
I missed seeing
you hand out velvet flowers.

13:23.520 --> 13:25.600
Since you were late,
would you accept a punishment?

13:25.680 --> 13:26.600
I would.

13:27.760 --> 13:28.800
Hit me.

13:34.360 --> 13:35.280
Let that be your vow:

13:35.360 --> 13:37.120
For the decades to come,

13:37.200 --> 13:38.480
you will make it up to me,
little by little.

13:38.560 --> 13:40.240
I will!

13:41.680 --> 13:43.040
BROCADE MASTER

13:45.720 --> 13:47.960
So, it's the Brocade Master you're after.

13:48.040 --> 13:49.280
Because…

13:49.360 --> 13:50.360
my grandfather promised me

13:51.240 --> 13:53.600
if I could win the title
of Brocade Master this time,

13:54.520 --> 13:55.520
he would allow me

13:56.800 --> 13:57.720
to propose to you.

14:03.880 --> 14:06.920
What? It hasn't been launched yet,
and it's already working its magic?

14:07.000 --> 14:09.000
ZHAO XIUYUAN AND HIS BELOVED:
TOGETHER FOREVER

14:09.920 --> 14:10.960
Yingying.

14:11.040 --> 14:13.160
- Let's set it off.
- Set it off now!

14:21.160 --> 14:22.120
Careful!

14:30.320 --> 14:33.080
- Are you okay?
- I'm fine. Just a scratch.

14:33.840 --> 14:34.680
It's just a scrape.

14:34.760 --> 14:35.800
A little ointment will fix it.

14:41.840 --> 14:43.720
Thank you, Mr. Yang, for saving us.

14:43.800 --> 14:45.200
Thank you, Mr. Yang.

14:46.000 --> 14:47.320
Don't mention it.

14:47.400 --> 14:50.760
I did this, so that in the future,
when I need help

14:50.840 --> 14:52.040
with appraising silk or threads,

14:52.600 --> 14:53.600
I'll feel comfortable
asking for assistance.

14:55.520 --> 14:57.280
Mr. Yang, how did you know we were here?

14:59.560 --> 15:00.600
Who do you think would want to harm you?

15:00.680 --> 15:01.680
Mrs. Hua.

15:02.360 --> 15:03.520
Today at the Splendor Showcase,

15:03.600 --> 15:05.080
I completely embarrassed her.

15:05.160 --> 15:06.760
Other than her,
I can't think of anyone else.

15:08.200 --> 15:11.000
I was asking you.
How did it turn into you questioning me?

15:11.080 --> 15:12.200
How did you know she wanted to harm me?

15:13.160 --> 15:15.520
At the field, I noticed
something was off about her demeanor,

15:15.600 --> 15:16.720
so I stayed alert.

15:26.240 --> 15:27.480
This place is quite remote.

15:28.040 --> 15:30.360
Finding it took me considerable effort.

15:30.960 --> 15:33.200
I've long heard
of the bond between you two,

15:33.280 --> 15:35.040
a perfect match,
and childhood sweethearts.

15:35.120 --> 15:36.600
Seeing it today,

15:37.240 --> 15:38.360
it's just as they say.

15:41.560 --> 15:44.040
Mr. Yang, you have a keen eye.

15:45.320 --> 15:47.040
When it's our wedding day,

15:47.120 --> 15:49.640
the two of us should have
a good drink together.

15:52.440 --> 15:53.480
I'm fine.

15:54.200 --> 15:55.040
All right.

15:59.680 --> 16:01.120
Today's unexpected disaster

16:01.200 --> 16:04.200
was entirely thanks to your casual mention
at the Splendor Showcase.

16:04.920 --> 16:06.480
Mr. Yang, you won't
leave it unattended, will you?

16:06.560 --> 16:08.080
Miss Ji, that's not quite fair.

16:08.160 --> 16:11.080
Don't forget who asked me
to add that finishing touch.

16:11.680 --> 16:14.120
But Mrs. Hua was ready to kill someone!

16:14.200 --> 16:16.080
That's clearly
a challenge to your authority,

16:16.160 --> 16:17.840
a provocation to your dignity!

16:17.920 --> 16:19.480
Life-and-death matters are handled

16:20.120 --> 16:20.960
by the county magistrate.

16:22.720 --> 16:25.360
If you didn't want to get involved,

16:25.440 --> 16:26.880
why would you have saved me?

16:29.920 --> 16:30.960
You're betting I'd help you?

16:32.240 --> 16:34.720
Please, stand up for the people, Mr. Yang.

16:35.400 --> 16:36.800
If you help a humble girl like me,

16:36.880 --> 16:39.920
then, in the future,
I will serve you with all my heart.

16:42.360 --> 16:45.800
I'm afraid in the future,
you will come up with plenty of excuses.

16:46.560 --> 16:47.400
It's getting late.

16:47.480 --> 16:49.640
Zhao Xiuyuan, perhaps
you should take Miss Ji home now.

16:51.040 --> 16:52.840
Miss Ji, if you don't want
Zhao Xiuyuan to escort,

16:52.920 --> 16:54.280
then I can personally see you home.

16:54.360 --> 16:55.280
No need!

16:56.680 --> 16:57.760
We'll leave.

17:02.040 --> 17:03.080
Yingying,

17:03.680 --> 17:04.760
are you close

17:05.760 --> 17:06.800
to Mr. Yang?

17:06.880 --> 17:09.560
I know him because I need his help.

17:09.640 --> 17:13.560
But I know you because I want to know you.

17:19.319 --> 17:20.440
Mr. Yang!

17:24.880 --> 17:26.720
- Mr. Yang.
- Did you track the assassin?

17:26.800 --> 17:28.400
Our people are monitoring them in secret.

17:30.080 --> 17:31.280
Look at this arrow.

17:31.360 --> 17:33.240
It's a military arrow.

17:33.320 --> 17:36.160
Is the person behind the Hua family
that powerful?

17:37.320 --> 17:39.120
The Hua family is a breakthrough point.

17:39.200 --> 17:40.440
We must investigate further.

18:10.960 --> 18:12.240
No improvement in skills,

18:12.320 --> 18:14.880
but your boldness keeps growing.

18:14.960 --> 18:15.880
Please calm down, my lady.

18:15.960 --> 18:18.960
I just wanted to help you
get rid of Ji Yingying, that troublemaker!

18:20.920 --> 18:23.760
You bribed my people
to do something behind me.

18:24.920 --> 18:25.960
Who are you doing all this for?

18:26.880 --> 18:28.160
Do I really need to spell it out?

18:30.000 --> 18:30.840
My lady…

18:32.760 --> 18:34.160
Did you leave any evidence?

18:34.240 --> 18:35.640
Rest assured, my lady.

18:36.200 --> 18:38.360
I had instructed them beforehand.

18:38.440 --> 18:39.840
Whether the assassination
succeeded or not,

18:39.920 --> 18:41.760
they would hide in a separate residence

18:41.840 --> 18:43.080
and not show up for a few days.

18:46.400 --> 18:50.720
For someone who doesn't even know
who their real master is,

18:51.840 --> 18:53.400
what's the use of keeping them?

18:55.000 --> 18:56.440
Our lady is merciful,

18:56.520 --> 18:57.760
leaving him a whole body.

19:00.120 --> 19:02.560
I'll serve you with all my might,
with no disloyalty at all!

19:02.640 --> 19:04.400
Please do a fair judgment, my lady!

19:17.000 --> 19:19.840
Our people report
that the assassin is dead.

19:19.920 --> 19:22.320
He was suddenly killed
by an arrow of his kind.

19:23.240 --> 19:24.080
Where did he die?

19:24.720 --> 19:27.280
In a separate residence of the Hua family.

19:33.240 --> 19:35.240
My dear, you're back!

19:35.320 --> 19:36.840
Why so late?

19:36.920 --> 19:38.120
What did the master say?

19:39.480 --> 19:41.120
Why do you look so pale?

19:41.960 --> 19:44.600
My dear, say something.

19:46.160 --> 19:47.600
Please, say something.

19:47.680 --> 19:48.800
You're scaring me being like this.

19:54.840 --> 19:57.760
Is the master going to punish us?

20:00.640 --> 20:02.840
She ordered me
to turn in all private accounts

20:05.280 --> 20:06.200
and commanded me

20:07.080 --> 20:08.240
never to meddle

20:08.320 --> 20:09.840
in Ji Yingying
or the mountain affairs again.

20:11.840 --> 20:13.760
If so, just tell her it was all my doing.

20:13.840 --> 20:14.920
Punish me instead!

20:15.000 --> 20:16.120
Hua Xiangrong,

20:16.960 --> 20:18.200
don't you get it?

20:19.760 --> 20:21.040
She's abandoned us.

20:23.280 --> 20:24.960
I know so many of her secrets.

20:27.160 --> 20:29.040
She'll never let me go.

20:31.200 --> 20:32.560
Then, let's leave now.
Run away immediately!

20:32.640 --> 20:33.880
We can't escape.

20:35.160 --> 20:36.880
She's capable of killing!

20:56.760 --> 20:59.560
Who's reckless enough to smash my window?

21:05.480 --> 21:07.240
Why are you sneaking
into my house so late?

21:07.320 --> 21:09.160
I'm testing you.

21:09.240 --> 21:10.960
After just encountering
an assassin, you're this careless.

21:11.040 --> 21:12.600
If I were a villain,
I'd have taken you away already.

21:12.680 --> 21:14.960
Smashing my window
makes you no different from a villain.

21:19.440 --> 21:21.240
Mr. Yang, this is truly impolite.

21:22.280 --> 21:23.560
I've found out

21:23.640 --> 21:25.440
that the person who tried
to assassinate you is Mrs. Hua.

21:26.240 --> 21:27.080
I knew it.

21:28.000 --> 21:29.280
The imperial yellow silk
is also from her family.

21:31.560 --> 21:33.000
That's your business.

21:33.560 --> 21:35.200
I'll leave it to you, Mr. Yang.
See you later.

21:36.240 --> 21:38.320
Zhuge and I have reviewed
the Hua family's accounts for a long time,

21:38.400 --> 21:40.040
but we still haven't found any clues.

21:40.120 --> 21:42.560
I know you're an expert in this area.

21:42.640 --> 21:44.160
I'd like to ask for your help.

21:45.960 --> 21:47.560
- Now?
- Yes.

21:49.000 --> 21:50.400
Delays will bring complications.

21:50.480 --> 21:52.960
The assassin who tried to kill you
is already dead.

22:09.360 --> 22:10.760
Looks like it's really late.

22:20.240 --> 22:22.160
Let's go.
Let's investigate her thoroughly.

22:23.800 --> 22:24.640
Where will you go toward?

22:42.040 --> 22:42.880
Let's go.

22:44.320 --> 22:46.240
Yang Jinglan, I'm going to kill you!

23:09.080 --> 23:10.920
All right, it's bright enough.

23:11.000 --> 23:13.280
Be careful. Don't burn the accounts.

23:41.400 --> 23:43.520
If you can't understand them,
just sit quietly to the side.

23:43.600 --> 23:46.640
Not meddling is also a way of helping.

23:48.360 --> 23:50.360
You talk as if you can understand them.

23:50.440 --> 23:51.920
Of course I can. Think about it…

23:52.000 --> 23:53.440
If she really did something wrong,

23:53.520 --> 23:54.920
she must have a private ledger.

23:55.000 --> 23:56.680
How could it be recorded
in the public accounts?

23:58.640 --> 23:59.880
Do you know what a fake account is?

24:00.960 --> 24:02.520
It's a mix of truth and lies.

24:02.600 --> 24:04.560
It can't be entirely real,
but it also can't be entirely false.

24:05.600 --> 24:07.280
Even if she has a private ledger,

24:07.360 --> 24:09.920
her public accounts
couldn't possibly leave no traces at all.

24:10.520 --> 24:12.680
Otherwise, the accounts wouldn't balance.

24:16.400 --> 24:18.120
It sounds like you're an expert
in making fake accounts.

24:24.480 --> 24:27.200
Why is it so hot in the Brocade Bureau?

24:28.000 --> 24:29.080
Zhuge, fan her.

24:31.560 --> 24:32.400
Mr. Yang,

24:33.040 --> 24:35.920
some things are better done personally.

24:40.280 --> 24:41.360
I'm suffocating here!

24:45.800 --> 24:46.720
Understood.

24:59.600 --> 25:00.920
Why can't I feel any breeze?

25:03.160 --> 25:04.360
Is this better now?

25:10.000 --> 25:10.840
Mr. Yang…

25:12.040 --> 25:14.040
I'll cool your head first, then your feet.

25:16.040 --> 25:17.320
There's something wrong with the accounts.

25:18.120 --> 25:19.200
What did you find?

25:24.040 --> 25:25.080
Look at this.

25:25.160 --> 25:27.440
This account seems fine,

25:27.520 --> 25:30.480
but its flaw is that it seems too perfect.

25:31.200 --> 25:34.960
First, normal accounts
inevitably have errors,

25:35.040 --> 25:38.000
with traces
of corrections or modifications.

25:38.080 --> 25:40.440
But this one is unusually neat.

25:41.680 --> 25:42.720
Second,

25:44.640 --> 25:46.640
the silk-dyeing business is tough.

25:46.720 --> 25:49.760
Every household has to play
some tricks with the accounts.

25:49.840 --> 25:51.360
Someone like Mrs. Hua,

25:51.440 --> 25:53.760
who always takes advantage where she can,

25:53.840 --> 25:57.440
shows no sign
of any scheming in her accounts.

25:57.520 --> 26:00.520
The entire account looks pre-written.

26:02.000 --> 26:04.200
The way she puts it does make some sense.

26:05.640 --> 26:06.520
Look here.

26:07.400 --> 26:08.680
They purchased a large batch of raw silk,

26:08.760 --> 26:11.240
hired the Shen family to reel and dye it,

26:11.840 --> 26:13.760
but it turned into waste silk.
There's a deficit in the accounts.

26:14.960 --> 26:17.680
From what I know,
in all their years of operation,

26:17.760 --> 26:18.800
the Shen family has never made

26:18.880 --> 26:21.160
such a mistake
that ruins an entire batch of silk.

26:21.240 --> 26:23.360
And based on what I know about Mrs. Hua,

26:23.440 --> 26:24.920
if something like this happened,

26:25.000 --> 26:26.600
even if she didn't demand compensation,

26:26.680 --> 26:29.600
she would have found a way
to sell the waste silk out.

26:30.280 --> 26:31.840
Take a look at the subsequent entries.

26:38.840 --> 26:41.360
These subsequent entries in the accounts
show no compensation

26:41.960 --> 26:43.120
nor any discounted sales.

26:44.320 --> 26:45.360
So, where did this batch of silk go?

26:46.360 --> 26:48.880
Perhaps the Shen family
never received this batch of silk at all.

26:50.040 --> 26:51.600
Exactly.

26:51.680 --> 26:53.160
ACCOUNT BOOK OF THE SHEN DYEHOUSE

26:58.800 --> 27:03.480
THE ACCOUNTS

27:03.560 --> 27:05.240
Using fake transactions like this,

27:05.320 --> 27:07.800
how much has the Hua family
exploited in a year?

27:08.400 --> 27:09.920
It's not just fake transactions.

27:10.000 --> 27:12.280
If we compare
the ledgers thoroughly one by one,

27:12.360 --> 27:13.720
we'll uncover even more issues.

27:14.400 --> 27:16.880
That's enough. We've found a direction.
Leave the rest to him.

27:21.920 --> 27:22.960
All right.

27:23.960 --> 27:26.080
Can he handle all of these by himself?

27:26.160 --> 27:27.640
Don't worry. This single discovery alone

27:27.720 --> 27:29.040
is enough to convict the Hua family.

27:29.680 --> 27:30.720
You won't suffer injustice in vain.

27:32.160 --> 27:34.720
I'm not doing this
to target the Hua family.

27:40.000 --> 27:42.480
If I told you I truly love Shu brocade

27:42.560 --> 27:44.160
and don't want anyone to spoil it,

27:44.800 --> 27:45.880
would you believe me?

27:58.680 --> 27:59.520
It doesn't matter if you don't.

28:19.760 --> 28:20.800
Let's go.

28:21.920 --> 28:23.000
No need.

28:23.080 --> 28:24.680
I have another way in.

28:24.760 --> 28:27.080
Besides, if you disturb Guo Kui inside,

28:27.160 --> 28:28.720
it might bite you to death.

28:28.800 --> 28:30.160
Mr. Yang, just see me off here.

28:32.400 --> 28:34.680
A young lady sneaking
through a dog hole every day…

28:35.560 --> 28:36.400
Ji Yingying!

28:47.480 --> 28:48.600
Yang Jinglan!

28:50.200 --> 28:51.480
Look how obedient it is.

28:51.560 --> 28:53.000
Not barking or biting.

28:53.080 --> 28:55.640
Guo Kui, Why are you
siding with an outsider?

28:55.720 --> 28:56.800
Guo Kui.

28:58.000 --> 28:58.880
It's true,

28:58.960 --> 29:00.800
an evil dog meets
its match in a worse person.

29:02.440 --> 29:03.840
In your eyes,

29:03.920 --> 29:05.720
am I only fit to be called a villain?

29:07.800 --> 29:09.960
If the accounts truly have issues,

29:10.040 --> 29:11.320
would you really arrest the Hua family?

29:12.840 --> 29:14.000
Why we investigate her
if we don't plan to arrest her?

29:15.280 --> 29:17.240
All right, good boy.

29:19.960 --> 29:22.320
The Hua family's backer
might be in Chang'an.

29:24.040 --> 29:25.480
So what?

29:25.560 --> 29:27.080
Be cautious.

29:31.040 --> 29:32.120
Miss Ji,

29:33.040 --> 29:34.440
if I say

29:34.520 --> 29:36.920
I sincerely wish to reform
Yizhou's brocade industry

29:37.000 --> 29:40.000
and clear the innocent of false charges,
would you believe me?

29:43.160 --> 29:45.520
It doesn't matter if you don't.
I'm leaving.

29:51.360 --> 29:52.880
He may not be a good man,

29:53.560 --> 29:55.080
but he seems to be a good official.

29:56.720 --> 29:58.080
You're right!

30:28.360 --> 30:29.280
What are you doing?

30:30.320 --> 30:32.680
How dare you trespass on my house?

30:33.840 --> 30:35.040
Mrs. Hua,

30:39.600 --> 30:40.440
how have you been?

30:42.440 --> 30:43.360
Mr. Yang,

30:44.080 --> 30:45.160
how have you been?

30:47.920 --> 30:49.040
Very well.

30:52.240 --> 30:53.480
I recall

30:54.240 --> 30:56.200
that I used to pay my respects to you.

30:57.560 --> 30:59.080
Even if it wasn't much,

30:59.680 --> 31:01.600
it shouldn't warrant you
raiding my home today.

31:02.360 --> 31:04.520
Hua's Dyehouse Ledger
Your family falsified accounts

31:04.600 --> 31:05.560
to evade taxes.

31:05.640 --> 31:07.440
Do you really think I know nothing?

31:07.520 --> 31:09.120
HUA'S DYEHOUSE LEDGER

31:12.400 --> 31:13.440
Mr. Yang.

31:14.160 --> 31:15.040
We didn't find Hua Xiangrong.

31:19.480 --> 31:20.320
Mrs. Hua,

31:20.960 --> 31:21.840
where is he?

31:23.360 --> 31:24.480
How would I know?

31:25.160 --> 31:27.760
He usually like to mess around outside.

31:28.480 --> 31:30.880
Last night, I scolded him a bit,

31:30.960 --> 31:32.240
and he ran off.

31:32.320 --> 31:35.360
Why not catch him for me?

31:38.680 --> 31:39.600
Fine.

31:40.520 --> 31:43.480
Then I'll trouble you
to come with me first.

31:44.080 --> 31:45.040
Please.

31:57.120 --> 32:00.080
Yang Jinglan arrested Mrs. Hua
without letting her explain.

32:00.160 --> 32:01.640
Did he uncover something?

32:01.720 --> 32:03.160
Or is he just endlessly greedy,

32:03.920 --> 32:05.080
doing this

32:05.840 --> 32:07.040
to gain more benefits?

32:07.800 --> 32:08.800
It has nothing to do with us.

32:10.720 --> 32:12.360
But what if Mrs. Hua

32:12.440 --> 32:14.680
speaks everything she knows?

32:16.080 --> 32:17.280
Should we…

32:18.160 --> 32:19.320
Keep her alive for now.

32:20.200 --> 32:23.400
Let's see
what Yang Jinglan's true motives are.

32:25.800 --> 32:29.320
But Mrs. Hua
knows some details about the mountain.

32:30.000 --> 32:32.920
What if Yang Jinglan
investigates the mountain?

32:36.240 --> 32:39.480
If he is as reckless
as the previous brocade officer,

32:41.600 --> 32:43.840
then let him go and never return.

32:45.480 --> 32:46.720
What about Ji Yingying?

32:47.840 --> 32:49.480
The general's letter mentioned

32:49.560 --> 32:51.240
that the court is seeking Shu Red Silk.

32:51.920 --> 32:55.120
If we can make her reveal
Shu Red Silk's secret,

32:55.680 --> 32:57.520
wouldn't that be a great achievement?

32:58.680 --> 33:00.200
After Ji Guinan's death,

33:00.280 --> 33:02.600
all of Yizhou
has been watching the Ji family.

33:03.600 --> 33:04.840
Have they uncovered anything?

33:06.680 --> 33:08.440
So, you mean…

33:09.960 --> 33:12.840
If there's no real Shu Red Silk,

33:12.920 --> 33:14.000
what we have

33:14.760 --> 33:15.960
will be considered real.

33:47.680 --> 33:48.720
Mr. Yang,

33:49.920 --> 33:51.920
please spare me.

33:53.320 --> 33:55.320
It's been three days,
and she still hasn't spoken?

33:57.880 --> 33:59.120
I've heard it said

34:00.440 --> 34:02.720
that if someone is deprived
of sleep for too long,

34:03.560 --> 34:05.920
they may go mad, or even die.

34:06.680 --> 34:07.800
Mrs. Hua,

34:07.880 --> 34:10.360
I advise you to think carefully
before answering.

34:14.520 --> 34:15.400
I…

34:17.159 --> 34:18.239
I confess.

34:22.400 --> 34:23.760
I was greedy,

34:26.040 --> 34:28.920
and I feared Ji Yingying's talent.

34:29.000 --> 34:32.120
So, I deliberately used
the Ji family's debts

34:33.320 --> 34:34.960
to suppress them.

34:35.600 --> 34:39.040
Framing Ji Yaoting was also my plan.

34:39.120 --> 34:41.040
It was to force Ji Yingying

34:42.719 --> 34:46.480
to give up
Mr. Zhao Senior's recommendation,

34:47.159 --> 34:50.280
so I could enslave the Ji family.

34:51.040 --> 34:54.760
But then Ji Yingying
created a new dye color,

34:54.840 --> 34:55.960
and I…

34:57.280 --> 34:59.480
in a moment of foolishness,

35:00.720 --> 35:03.760
resorted to hiring an assassin.

35:05.120 --> 35:07.360
I know I was wrong.

35:11.080 --> 35:12.480
Please, Mr. Yang,

35:14.560 --> 35:17.240
considering that Ji Yingying is unharmed,

35:20.320 --> 35:22.000
spare my life.

35:23.280 --> 35:24.320
If you want to accuse me

35:24.400 --> 35:25.960
of only caring
about profit and not people,

35:26.040 --> 35:27.360
there's no need to be so indirect.

35:28.720 --> 35:29.960
Isn't that true?

35:31.880 --> 35:33.120
Have you ever lacked money?

35:33.880 --> 35:35.240
A gentleman loves wealth
but acquires it through proper means.

35:35.320 --> 35:36.760
Have you ever been driven to desperation?

35:37.880 --> 35:39.120
Finding hope in despair,

35:40.000 --> 35:41.240
breaking but not bending.

35:41.920 --> 35:43.320
You're valiant enough.

35:43.400 --> 35:44.560
But I can't do it.

35:44.640 --> 35:47.080
I only care about profit,
petty and selfish.

35:47.960 --> 35:50.720
So, she truly had no choice.

36:11.240 --> 36:12.720
Other than hiring an assassin,

36:14.080 --> 36:15.200
are there any other crimes?

36:18.200 --> 36:19.320
No.

36:20.720 --> 36:21.720
Truly, no more.

36:23.360 --> 36:25.800
You've done so many bad things
at Huanhua Creek.

36:26.320 --> 36:28.240
Who's backing you?

36:29.360 --> 36:30.640
It's all me.

36:30.720 --> 36:32.680
I had my own plans for business.

36:32.760 --> 36:34.440
Then, what were you planning

36:36.280 --> 36:37.600
with this imperial yellow silk?

36:39.400 --> 36:41.160
This silk…

36:41.240 --> 36:43.360
Are you planning to weave a dragon robe
for yourself on the mountain?

36:43.960 --> 36:45.840
I'm only responsible
for delivering the silk thread

36:45.920 --> 36:47.160
to the cave at Beiling Pass.

36:47.240 --> 36:49.000
After that, I know nothing.

36:49.080 --> 36:50.800
I was just forced to do business.

36:50.880 --> 36:52.640
- I don't know anything else…
- Who's forcing you?

37:06.720 --> 37:07.680
You won't tell me?

37:09.320 --> 37:11.760
Do you think the person forcing you
will come save you,

37:11.840 --> 37:15.280
or are you hoping
Hua Xiangrong will come save you?

37:19.680 --> 37:21.760
Or is it because of Hua Xiangrong

37:21.840 --> 37:24.080
that someone has to come save you?

37:26.880 --> 37:29.920
Is there really no way out?

37:31.200 --> 37:32.240
There is.

37:37.640 --> 37:38.840
Let's cut off the source.

37:39.880 --> 37:41.120
Between us,

37:42.080 --> 37:42.960
one must go.

37:44.880 --> 37:46.160
If I leave,

37:47.680 --> 37:49.560
taking all the secrets with me,

37:50.880 --> 37:52.000
and you stay behind,

37:52.640 --> 37:53.680
you won't survive.

37:55.480 --> 37:57.720
But if you take all the secrets with you,

37:58.680 --> 38:00.800
she won't dare act rashly.

38:01.920 --> 38:03.840
At least she'll spare my life,

38:04.760 --> 38:06.200
maybe even get me out of there.

38:15.280 --> 38:16.160
Hua Xiangrong,

38:18.280 --> 38:19.480
out there,

38:22.560 --> 38:24.880
you're my hope for survival.

38:37.840 --> 38:39.920
Add two more fire pits for Mrs. Hua.

38:40.000 --> 38:41.320
Make this place brighter!

38:41.400 --> 38:43.320
Beat the gong more frequently!

38:52.520 --> 38:53.760
Do you think what she says is credible?

38:53.840 --> 38:56.160
Even if there's deceit,
there must be some truth.

38:56.240 --> 38:57.520
Otherwise, how could she deceive me?

38:58.440 --> 38:59.840
You're playing with fire.

38:59.920 --> 39:01.280
Don't worry. It won't burn you.

39:01.880 --> 39:04.280
Right now, we have no other leads.

39:04.360 --> 39:07.320
Even if it's a trap,
we have to give it a try.

39:08.600 --> 39:11.960
Send the secret guards
to search the area she mentioned.

39:12.040 --> 39:14.280
If anything seems off,
don't act recklessly.

39:14.360 --> 39:15.920
- Wait for me to arrive.
- Understood.

39:21.680 --> 39:24.600
YUEBUHUAN INN

39:25.920 --> 39:27.720
Keep your arm straight. Bend your knees.

39:28.440 --> 39:30.120
- They're bent already…
- Don't stick your butt out.

39:31.760 --> 39:32.640
Shift your weight lower.

39:35.000 --> 39:37.400
Not that low. Stand up.

39:38.280 --> 39:40.040
All right, stop. Keep your back straight.

39:40.560 --> 39:42.000
Yu,

39:42.080 --> 39:44.000
I still have to dye silk.

39:44.840 --> 39:48.600
I can't just be slacking off
while everyone else is working hard.

39:49.880 --> 39:52.920
Don't you remember
who almost got hurt a few days ago?

39:53.000 --> 39:55.160
I know you mean well, but…

39:55.240 --> 39:56.120
Squat down.

39:58.280 --> 39:59.880
But if I face danger again,

39:59.960 --> 40:01.520
I can't just squat there, can I?

40:02.120 --> 40:03.520
Why don't you teach me something else…

40:04.120 --> 40:05.000
Something more practical,

40:05.080 --> 40:06.320
a one-move takedown kind of thing?

40:06.400 --> 40:09.280
It's so quiet in the shop,
not a single customer.

40:11.320 --> 40:12.280
Oh, you're practicing martial arts?

40:13.640 --> 40:15.640
Come on, I'll teach you some moves.

40:16.240 --> 40:17.240
No…

40:18.560 --> 40:20.120
If you're going to teach me

40:20.200 --> 40:21.600
horse stance
or striking wooden stakes again,

40:21.680 --> 40:22.800
then forget it.

40:22.880 --> 40:24.120
I'm really not cut out for this.

40:25.080 --> 40:26.240
Don't worry.

40:26.320 --> 40:27.680
Based on what I saw of you that day,

40:27.760 --> 40:29.280
this move is perfect for you.

40:30.280 --> 40:31.160
Watch carefully.

40:32.960 --> 40:34.040
If you're in danger,

40:35.000 --> 40:36.920
aim for the enemy's lower body

40:37.000 --> 40:38.160
and kick with all your might.

40:40.480 --> 40:41.960
One move to defeat them.
It's very effective.

40:44.000 --> 40:45.840
- That's not a bad idea.
- Give it a try.

40:52.480 --> 40:53.480
You're really going to try?

40:54.160 --> 40:55.320
That looks painful.

40:55.400 --> 40:57.040
Your foot will hurt more.

40:59.000 --> 41:00.160
Stop laughing.

41:00.240 --> 41:02.080
Can't you teach her something proper?

41:02.840 --> 41:03.720
All right.

41:06.320 --> 41:07.320
I'll teach you something else.

41:09.360 --> 41:10.720
What other move?

41:10.800 --> 41:12.120
How about learning to ride a horse?

41:12.200 --> 41:13.480
What's the use of that?

41:13.560 --> 41:14.920
If you can't fight, you can run.

41:15.000 --> 41:16.440
On horseback, nobody can catch you.

41:16.520 --> 41:17.360
Guaranteed success.

41:18.400 --> 41:20.680
- But…
- If you're teaching, teach properly.

41:21.360 --> 41:22.560
I'll go get you some snacks.

41:28.040 --> 41:28.960
You didn't come here today

41:29.040 --> 41:31.240
just to teach me self-defense, did you?

41:32.400 --> 41:33.600
I came today

41:34.280 --> 41:35.840
to clear your worries.

41:41.080 --> 41:43.960
Right now, there's only one thing
on my mind.

41:44.760 --> 41:46.320
Registering Flushed Rose for the records.

41:46.920 --> 41:49.080
The inspection in Yizhou is complete.

41:49.720 --> 41:51.440
As for the seal, I've already stamped it.

41:51.520 --> 41:54.120
Tomorrow, I'll send someone to deliver it.

41:54.720 --> 41:56.600
Who's delivering it? Zhuge?

41:57.280 --> 41:59.120
Him? That'd be
more like delivering his life.

42:03.160 --> 42:05.760
PLEASE APPROVE
JI YINGYING TO SELL FLUSHED ROSE SILK

42:09.480 --> 42:12.080
The person behind Mrs. Hua
is no ordinary figure.

42:13.040 --> 42:15.520
She has confessed to me
everything she's done.

42:18.040 --> 42:20.960
I used to think
you were solely focused on business,

42:21.040 --> 42:22.000
uninterested in anything else.

42:22.640 --> 42:23.720
But now, I see

42:24.520 --> 42:26.840
you really don't have that time.

42:28.760 --> 42:32.400
Just managing the present
is already no small task.

42:33.520 --> 42:34.840
I misspoke.

42:47.640 --> 42:48.840
In the entire city of Yizhou,

42:50.120 --> 42:52.920
some people have wronged my family,
scorned my family,

42:53.680 --> 42:54.960
or falsely accused my family…

42:56.640 --> 42:58.160
Of them all, you're the first one

42:59.320 --> 43:00.840
to apologize to my family.
